      },
      {
        "text": "Notes:\n1) No more than 2 courses from a single discipline can be used to meet the Breadth Requirement.\n2) Students must complete 60 units outside the primary discipline of the first major, regardless of the department who offers the course(s) in that discipline. (Courses include general education courses, transfer courses, CPCE/EXTN units, internships, etc.)",
